00 from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, nonstop, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. The only cheaper option, F120 at $199, has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. Dana's reservations then showed the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. Booking the trip again would have charged for the flight twice, so I booked the hotel on its own instead. A final check shows exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicate charges. The only difference from what you asked for is that they're two separate reservations rather than one combined booking.", "type": "text"}]}]}